{"id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-boolean-evaluation.md","title":"Boolean Valuation and Evaluation","display":"df-boolean-evaluation — Boolean Valuation and Evaluation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","aliases":["28-df-boolean-evaluation"],"display":"df-boolean-evaluation — Boolean Valuation and Evaluation","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-literal]]","[[28-df-cnf]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion","source_printed_pages":"44–45","source_pdf_pages":"70–71","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-boolean-evaluation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-boolean-evaluation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-evaluation — Boolean Valuation and Evaluation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"44–45"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"70–71"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> (命题变量集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span> (布尔公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (布尔赋值)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{PropVar})\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{PropVar})\\)</span> (公式变量函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (公式求值函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{Lit}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{Lit}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (文字求值函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}:\\mathrm{CNF}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> (CNF 求值函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" href=\"?note=c8f19b1793fdfb6a\" title=\"28-df-cnf\">28-df-cnf</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\\{x\\}&amp;\\varphi=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\\{x\\}&amp;\\varphi=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\psi)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{B}}(\\chi)&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\circ\\chi),\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\\alpha(x)&amp;\\varphi=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\1-\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\min(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi),\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\land\\chi)\\\\\\max(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi),\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi)\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq_{\\mathrm{ind}}\\begin{cases}\\alpha(x)&amp;\\varphi=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\1-\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi)&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi\\\\\\min(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi),\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\land\\chi)\\\\\\max(\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\psi),\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\chi))&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi)\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha(x)&amp;\\ell=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\1-\\alpha(x)&amp;\\ell=\\neg x,\\;x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\alpha(x)&amp;\\ell=x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\\\1-\\alpha(x)&amp;\\ell=\\neg x,\\;x\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\min_{C\\in\\Phi}\\max_{\\ell\\in C}\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}(\\ell),\\qquad\\min\\emptyset\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\max\\emptyset\\coloneqq0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNFEval}_{\\alpha}(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\min_{C\\in\\Phi}\\max_{\\ell\\in C}\\mathrm{LitVal}_{\\alpha}(\\ell),\\qquad\\min\\emptyset\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\max\\emptyset\\coloneqq0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>最后一个等式与 CNF 的有限子句集表示一致，并明确给出空合取与空析取的约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§2.3.1; local tagged syntax and recursion，印刷页 44–45；PDF 页 70–71。已比对相应陈述。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-formula","status":"resolved","id":"b830febc662345bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"c8f19b1793fdfb6a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exce